{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"PluralKit","id":"466378653216014359","is_bot":1,"username":"PluralKit"},"author_id":"466378653216014359","channel_id":"850779383656218636","content":"> **About PluralKit**\nPluralKit detects messages enclosed in specific tags associated with a profile, then replaces that message under a \"pseudo-account\" of that profile using Discord webhooks.\n\nThis is useful for multiple people sharing one body (aka. *systems*), people who wish to role-play as different characters without having multiple Discord accounts, or anyone else who may want to post messages under a different identity from the same Discord account.\n\nDue to Discord limitations, these messages will show up with the `[BOT]` tag - however, they are not bots.","created_at":"2021-07-11T01:08:57.540000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863587637827076106","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
